// SubTitle Strings Select which type of exercises to show in your Fit Journal Create a new workout to add to your library Update your workout below Current Workout Type: Let\'s quickly go through how to track your workouts and crush your goals. Take control of your fitness journey with Fit Journal, the simple and effective way to track your daily workouts. For further assistance, refer to the help icon in the top-right corner of your Journal. on %1$s?
// General Strings Total Distance: %1$s %2$s or %3$s %4$s Total Time: %1$s Total Reps: %1$s Total Sets: %1$s Total Laps: %1$s Total Weight: %1$s %2$s or %3$s %4$s Total Weight in Volume: %1$s %2$s or %3$s %4$s Click to view/edit workout Add to Journal Clear Filter Add to Library Ex: Jumping Jacks "Library "Journal "Statistics Weight Training Cardio Calisthenics Edit Your Workout Below Chosen Date: Go back to Journal Go back to Workout List N/A %1$s miles %1$s Rep Max %1$s lbs Can\'t find a workout? Create one here here Squats Click \'Start\' to begin! This is your personal workout journal, providing a comprehensive overview of your exercise activity. You have full control to add, modify, or remove entries as needed. Your workout journal is powered by your Workout Library. Create and customize your workouts here, then seamlessly add them to your journal for tracking. The Statistics screen provides a comprehensive overview of your fitness progress, with tailored insights for each type of workout you log.
